  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "Our family meets at the table for dinner after a long day, and I am hungry. Mother is ready to serve the chicken, while Grandfather uses a spoon to taste the warm soup. He smiles and says it is delicious, so I want some too. My brother helps pass the bowl of rice to me, and I put a little on my plate. I use my fork to eat a piece of chicken and then choose a vegetable from the big bowl. Everyone has a glass of water, and we share the food so each person can try something. Grandmother is full, so she holds up her hand when Mother offers her more. We listen to her story about our father when he was little, and everyone looks happy. I leave a little room for fruit and thank everyone for a meal we can enjoy together.",
    "textZh": "忙了一整天後，我們全家在桌邊吃晚餐，我已經肚子餓了。媽媽準備端上雞肉，爺爺則用湯匙品嚐溫熱的湯。他微笑著說湯很好喝，所以我也想喝一些。弟弟幫忙把飯碗遞給我，我在自己的盤子裡盛了一點飯。我用叉子吃一塊雞肉，接著從大碗裡挑了一樣蔬菜。每個人都有一杯水，我們分享食物，讓每個人都能嚐一嚐。奶奶吃飽了，所以媽媽想再添食物給她時，她舉起手示意不用。我們聽她說爸爸小時候的故事，每個人都很開心。我留一點肚子的空間吃水果，也謝謝大家讓我們能一起享受這頓飯。",
